# 📸 LensCraft - Photography Portfolio Website

A clean, minimalist, and elegant photography portfolio website designed to showcase stunning visuals and galleries in a smooth, immersive way.

---

## 📝 Description

This project is my personal photography portfolio. It is a web platform built to highlight photos captured across various styles (such as landscapes, portraits, and street photography), providing visitors with a clean, fluid, and easy-to-navigate visual experience.

---

## 🖼️ Screenshots

*(Note: Make sure your image files are uploaded inside the `images/` folder in your repository so they load correctly without any glitching.)*

| Home Page | Gallery Section |
| :---: | :---: |
| ![Home Page](./images/home-screenshot.png) | ![Gallery View](./images/gallery-screenshot.png) |

---

## 🚀 Tech Stack

* **Front-end:** HTML5, CSS3 / Sass, JavaScript (Vanilla)
* **Design / UI:** Flexbox, CSS Grid, Responsive Design
* **Hosting / Live Demo:** GitHub Pages / Vercel

---

## ✨ Features

* 📱 **Fully Responsive Design** (looks flawless on phones, tablets, and desktops).
* 🌌 **Interactive Photo Gallery** with a lightbox effect for high-resolution image viewing.
* ⚡ **Optimized Asset Loading** for fast browsing speeds.
* 🌙 **Light/Dark Theme** support for enhanced visual comfort.

---

## 🌐 Live Demo

You can view the live version of the website here: 👉 [https://quietbyte23.github.io/photography-portfolio](https://quietbyte23.github.io/photography-portfolio)

